# Services with build.context: . in docker-compose.full.yml send this whole
# directory as the build context -- without this file, that included the
# unrelated datadog/terraform/.terraform provider cache (1.5G+ of binaries)
# and every module's Maven target/ output, which was slow enough to break the
# tar stream mid-transfer (observed as "io: read/write on closed pipe" and a
# corrupted next build) when building over a podman machine socket.

datadog/terraform/.terraform/
datadog/terraform/*.tfstate
datadog/terraform/*.tfstate.backup
datadog/terraform/*.tfplan
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/.terraform/
.git/
*.log
.env
